<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>A task's logs, the same in every task: the input, the task file read at Go as JSON (TaskConfig through the task's own SerializeToJson), as Settings_Task; once the experiment folder exists (PathPrefix), WorkflowData_Trials (LogTrials of TrialRow, one row per trial); and Zapit's logs (OpenRigs.Devices ZapitLogs: each reply as an Events row named ZapitReply, and Settings_ZapitConditions in an optogenetics experiment). A task's other logs stay in the task. It has no output: an include ends its side branches when its output completes, and Settings_Task completes at Go, which ended the trial and Zapit logs before trial 1. Needs TrialRow, TaskConfig, ZapitReplies, Events, Timestamp and PathPrefix from the workflow.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
        <Name>Source1</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
        <Name>Settings_Task</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>TrialLogs</Name>
        <Description>The trial log, once the experiment folder exists (PathPrefix): WorkflowData_Trials.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialRow</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogTrials.bonsai" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:ZapitLogs.bonsai" />
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
